{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34177","headline":"杂讽九首 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"杂讽九首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"童麋来触犀，德力不相及。\n伊无惬心事，祗有碎首泣。\n况将鹏蝨校，数又百与十。\n攻如饿鸱呌，势若脱兔急。\n斯爲朽关键，怒荦抉以入。\n年来横干戈，未见拔城邑。\n得非佐饔者，齿齿待啜汁。\n羁维豪杰辈，四骇方少絷。\n此皆乘时利，纵舍在呼吸。\n吾欲斧其吭，无雷动幽蛰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}